{
  "id": "PrqaMainPipeline",
  "name": "PRQA 00 · Main Pipeline",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PRQA 00 · Main Pipeline\nOne orchestration for every repository. Stages run as sub-workflows so each can be reviewed and tested alone:\n**Policy Gate → 02 Context → 03 LLM Prompt → 04 OpenCode Job → 05 Validate & Report → 06 Discord + 07 GitHub comment**.\n\nError outputs of every stage go to *Record Stage Error*; unhandled errors go to *PRQA 08 · Error Handler* (workflow setting).",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "c88e5ac8-d293-54d3-939c-fa217d908bf6",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔒 Phase 1 — REVIEW ONLY\n`AUTOMATION_MODE=review_only` (compose/.env). The worker returns **mock** endpoints for GitHub, the prompt LLM and Discord, rejects every non-synthetic job with `REVIEW_ONLY_MODE`, and the registry has **0 enabled repositories**.\n\nNothing in this workflow can reach a real repository, API or channel until Phase 2 is explicitly approved.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "5b041453-2b52-54b5-9b91-72c119336847",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1008,
        -140
      ]
    },
