      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ▶ Manual synthetic test\nClick **Test workflow** with this trigger selected to run the whole pipeline against the synthetic fixture PR (#101 on `synthetic-org/sample-orders-api`). All external calls go to `prqa-mocks`.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
